This directory contains:

- xhtml1-strict.xsd, retrieved from:

    https://www.w3.org/2002/08/xhtml/xhtml1-strict.xsd

  …with one modification: the <xs:import> of the XML namespace schema
  (http://www.w3.org/2001/xml.xsd) is rewritten to refer to a local copy, so that
  using the schemas requires no network access.

- xml.xsd, retrieved from:

    https://www.w3.org/2001/xml.xsd

